{title: Tumi Moy}
{artist: Tahsan Khan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Keu bole chilo [D] bhalobashi,        Se chilo [E] nil chuye [F#m] rodher hasi
[D] Din gulo chilo [E] shopno jemon,        [Bm] Smriti gulo ajo [E] obinashi
[F#m] Joto ta peyechi,        [E] Tar cheyeo beshi
[D] Govire hridoye amar sob [A] tumi moy,        [F#m] Koto shrot bhengechi
[E] Bashte bhalo tomake,        [D] Abaro sei tomate
[A] khujechi ashroy.. [Bm] .. [E],        [F#m] Bodle hotath [D] bishader ei akash
Tobuo [A] du chokhe khuji [E] pichutaan,        [F#m] Tumake niye [D] hajaro ovilash
Chute [A] jaowa tai bhenge [E] oviman,        Aar [Bm] kichui chaini [E] jhokjon
[D] Tomake peyechi ei [E] mon,        [F#m] Joto ta peyechi
[E] Tar cheyeo beshi,        [D] Govire hridoye amar shob [A] tumi moy
[F#m] Koto shrot bhengechi,        [E] Bashte bhalo tomake
[D] Abaro sei tomate,        [A] khujechi ashroy.. [Bm] .. [E]
[F#m] Shei chena poth dhore [D] ager moto,        [A] Tomake chai aro [E] ekbaar...
[F#m] Bhalolaga shomoy gulo [D] ekhono,        Lege [A] ache duhaate [E] amar
[Bm] Vabnar akash [E] jure,        [D] Tomay paowa purota [E] shomoy
[F#m] Joto ta peyechi,        [E] Tar cheyeo beshi
[D] Govire hridoye amar shob [A] tumi moy,        [F#m] Koto shrot bhengechi
[E] Bashte bhalo tomake,        [D] Abaro sei tomate [A] khujechi ashroy
